</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00400/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一颗无论用什么方式都无法让其进入篮筐的篮球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-01与Site-CN-02友谊篮球赛赛场。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在比赛时一名队员尝试球不离开手强行塞入篮筐<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-339291-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-339291-1')">1</a></sup>时爆炸。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这个球是Site-CN-01与Site-CN-02友谊篮球赛时Site-CN-01在领先时Site-CN-01要求换的球。要不是这个知道这个消息，我都怀疑人生了。</em>——Site-CN-02尝试扣篮的球员</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00400" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00400" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00400-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tian-xiu233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6240575); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6240575&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607241084" alt="tian xiu233" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6240575)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tian-xiu233" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6240575); return false;">tian xiu233</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600595491 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 Sep 2020 09:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-339291-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-339291-1')">1</a>. 又名扣篮。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶喷雾式杀虫剂，瓶身商标为“鸵鸟”牌。吸入其喷出气雾的人类将无法通过视觉感知到一切蜚蠊科昆虫的存在，持续时间尚不明确。化验显示该物质并无杀虫功效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██厨师刘██宿舍中。刘██对其来历无清晰记忆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低危物品储存柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>在确认持续时间之前千万别放他回去工作！</em>——██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00044" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00044-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1418801&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607241084" alt="ahshow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1418801)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;">ahshow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586345583 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Apr 2020 11:33</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00469/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆苏制T-34/85坦克，除其搭载的85mm主炮与其机枪能够正常开火以外，其余性能均与正常“共产主义”拖拉机相同。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82附近一博物馆内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于Site-CN-82异常武器仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>所以这就是你们说T-34是拖拉机的理由？</em>-Dr.Tian<br />
<em>不过至少还能开炮，还是85。</em>-正在试图爬上项目的Dr.Leo</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00469" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00469" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00469-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607241084" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1606043413 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Nov 2020 11:10</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00358/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个品牌不明的现代抽水马桶，接近者常报告称听到其内部发出类似求救的声音，但无法被录音设备证实。当有生物将头部伸进马桶内时，通常马桶盖会突然以极快的速度迅猛关闭，大概率造成该生物颈部粉碎以及头身分离。在将该物品自发现地点拆卸并回收后，该异常效应仍旧存在。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>青海省海东市████公寓███室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██危险物品仓库</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00358" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00358" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00358-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chronoyuki" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5678469); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5678469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607241084" alt="ChronoYuki" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5678469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chronoyuki" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5678469); return false;">ChronoYuki</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597506678 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">15 Aug 2020 15:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
